    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "A boiler plant consists of the following particulars: Steam pressure= 20 bar, steam temperature= 260°C, steam generated= 40,000 kg, temperature of water entering the economiser = 20°C, temperature of water leaving the economiser= 92°C, fuel used = 4500 kg, energy of combustion of fuel = 30,000 kJ/kg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Calculate:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(i) The equivalent evaporation per kg of fuel"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(ii) The thermal efficiency of the plant and"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iii) The percentage of heat energy of the fuel utilized by the economiser."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "SECTION-B"
